# Ignore prompt files (*.md) inside any `tests/` directory at any depth.
# `**/tests/*.md` (not `tests/*.md`) is required because a pattern with a
# middle slash is rooted to the .gitignore location, so `tests/*.md` alone
# would only match `<repo-root>/tests/*.md`, missing the actual location at
# `openai_completions_agent_handler/tests/*.md`.
**/tests/*.md
